{"id":"n30202-1-8","stage":1,"title":"닭 · 鸡","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30202-1-8-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 일찍 일어났어?","zh":"怎么这么早就起床了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어났어?","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52dbf5cd137c972b5aa4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30202-1-8-2","ko":"새벽에 닭이 우는 소리에 깼어요.","zh":"是被凌晨鸡叫的声音吵醒的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새벽에","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닭이","meaning":"鸡","explanation":"닭：鸡；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"닭","audio":"/audio/82e5449c632286a1c5e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30202","senseId":"1","lemma":"닭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우는","meaning":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","explanation":"울다：啼，鸣，嚎叫；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"2","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리에","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깼어요.","meaning":"睡醒","explanation":"깨다：睡醒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"깨다","audio":"/audio/f06d1a21bd6ecee5f09d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62332","senseId":"3","lemma":"깨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d0a36389c6b198a1","term":"새벽","zh":"凌晨，早晨","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3","entryId":"62740","definition":"很早的上午时间。","pronunciation":["새벽"]},{"id":"82e5449c632286a1","term":"닭","zh":"鸡","audio":"/audio/82e5449c632286a1c5e5.mp3","entryId":"30202","definition":"一种不会飞，能产蛋，肉质鲜美，在家圈养的大鸟。","pronunciation":["닥"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"啼，鸣，嚎叫","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"动物、昆虫、风等发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f06d1a21bd6ecee5","term":"깨다",